2026-07-25 (later) — 322b: OWNER DESK-QA ON 3 LOOKS, ROOT-CAUSED + FIXED (2d35446)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Owner: look1 shader-only "hit or miss whether it plays at all"; media → look1
"does not perform mix transition"; look2 (shader+media) ↔ look3 (media) great.
ONE root cause, confirmed in journal + amcp-last50 at 14:04-14:05: the
crossfade OPACITY ramps ride sendStaggeredTakePlays as suffixAfterSources,
gated on sourceLines.length > 0 — template jobs have playPlan=null, so a
shader-ONLY look emits zero PLAY lines and the whole crossfade batch is
silently dropped (Phase A pre-hides incoming bank at OPACITY 0, ramp never
arrives → invisible on the above-outgoing bank parity = hit-or-miss; the
outgoing media's fade-to-0 is in the same dropped batch → hard cut at
teardown). Fix: new pipeline branch sends the crossfade batch directly when no
job emits PLAY lines, leading COMMIT first to flush the deferred pre-hide.
smoke-wo322 grew a behavioral (d) test (stub-AMCP pipeline drive; verified to
fail pre-fix). Gate 1510/2, no new lint.
*** SERVER change — NOT LIVE until next node restart. That restart also
completes the original 322 §BLOCKER check; expected after it: look1 takes
always show, media→look1 mixes. Revert candidates baf8211 + 2d35446. ***

